<title>USA: DG Systems to acquire  PDR Productions.</title>
<headline>DG Systems to acquire  PDR Productions.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DG Systems said it agreed to acquire PDR Productions, a New York-based media duplication and distribution company, in a cash and stock transaction valued at $8.5 million.</p>
<p>It said PDR operated profitably in 1995 and had revenues of more than $7.5 million.</p>
<p>DG Systems provides electronic distribution services to the broadcast industry.</p>
</text>
